; sfab-ch03 dns-res2, zone the root: rendered from spec/profile-a.yaml by render/dns.py; edit the spec and run make render
; The lab has no way out: this resolver is authoritative for an empty root, so a name outside
; the platform's zone gets NXDOMAIN at once and no query leaves the lab.
$ORIGIN .
$TTL 300
@ IN SOA dns-res2.ai.tarnwick.example. hostmaster.ai.tarnwick.example. (
    1918813926 ; serial, from the zone's data
    3600 ; refresh
    600 ; retry
    86400 ; expire
    60 ) ; negative answers
@                             IN NS  dns-res2.ai.tarnwick.example.
dns-res2.ai.tarnwick.example. IN A   10.20.14.21 ; name server
